{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"弧群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"弧群"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>一个群的<strong>弧群</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"形式圆盘","text":"形式圆盘"}},{"Plain":"到它的映射构成的群.</p>\n"}]}}